        <mxCell id="5vp2_YCSvexxTQXD4YBM-14" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=none;strokeColor=light-dark(#000000,#000000);fontColor=#111111;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=light-dark(#FFFFFF,#FFFFFF);" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(0, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. Secrets Manager&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(0, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;- Customer-Managed Key&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(0, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;- KMS-encrypted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(0, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;- Secret is generated by Terraform and never sits in code, tfvars or in an .env file&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
